    "Description": "The gstreamer1 packages contain a streaming media framework, based on graphs of filters which operate on media data. \n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* gstreamer: gstreamer: Use-after-free in GStreamer core buffer value deserialization (CVE-2026-125704)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
